| `handoff` | Rare — prefer fresh chat per slice |

## Ralph loop

1. STATUS `AFK_QUEUE` in master doc
2. **Morning automation** — brief + optional auto-start when gates pass
3. **Ralph continue on merge** — after S6b PR merges, auto-start next Lane A batch ([`workflow-cursor-automations.md`](../../docs/projects/workflow-cursor-automations.md))
4. `npm run mc:opener` or CEO: `Resume migration today` — manual kickoff / unblock
5. Auto-merge when policy allows

